<title>USA: Bay Medical Center, Fla., $56 mln priced.</title>
<headline>Bay Medical Center, Fla., $56 mln priced.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-10-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>First Union Capital Markets Corp said Tuesday it tentatively priced $56 million of Board of Trustees Bay Medical Center, Fla., hospital revenue refunding bonds, 1996, for Bay Medical Center project, with a top yield of 5.75 percent in 2026.</p>
<p>The bonds are AMBAC insured.</p>
